OL,3,AStorm Boelo hits UK with wind and rain
OL,4,Aas warnings issued for large parts of
OL,5,Acountry
OL,6,
OL,7,FFerry services in the Irish Sea are
OL,8,Fcancelled, and there are also
OL,9,Fcancellations on the CalMac service
OL,10,Faround the west coast of Scotland
OL,12,FMeanwhile, a marathon in the Eryri
OL,13,Fnational park in north Wales has been
OL,14,Fcancelled, as well as a range of events
OL,15,Fin Northern Ireland
OL,17,FTens of thousands of properties lost
OL,18,Fpower in south-west England on Friday -
OL,19,Fthousands are still waiting to be
OL,20,Freconnected
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
