OL,3,AMum dies after trying to rescue sons
OL,4,Aswept away at sea
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has died after attempting to
OL,7,Frescue her two sons when they were
OL,8,Fswept away while snorkelling in the
OL,9,FBahamas.
OL,11,FThe Royal Bahamas Police Force said
OL,12,Fofficers on the island of Bimini
OL,13,Flaunched an investigation into the
OL,14,Fsudden death of a 36-year-old British
OL,15,Fwoman on Tuesday.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,0,100
