OL,3,AFather who killed Oregon school gunman
OL,4,Adescribes anguish over children he
OL,5,Acouldn't save
OL,6,
OL,7,FA father who fatally shot a gunman at
OL,8,Fhis daughters' school in the US state
OL,9,Fof Oregon has described his anguish
OL,10,Fover being unable to save more pupils
OL,11,Fafter "hearing children pleading for
OL,12,Ftheir lives".
OL,14,FThree students and a teacher were
OL,15,Fkilled by a 16-year-old former student
OL,16,Fat Silver Rail Elementary School
OL,17,Fearlier this month. The attacker was
OL,18,Fthen killed by Kaylub Giamanco.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,0,100
